    "detailed_description": "The Gods are bored.. and they have decided to do battle against each other! By utilizing the greatest fighting factions in history, they do continuous battle for fame and glory! Chosen from the Spartans, Romans, and Vikings, to the Gladiators, Samurai, and Egyptians.. their <strong>arena battles are legendary</strong>!! Come join in today!<br><br>An alternative online trading card game that allows unlimited deck-building and competitors, both AI and live! Three different game modes that include Gauntlet, Solo, and Multiplayer options. Many player and deck customization options to earn and choose from. From Daily/Weekly Quests and Goals, to Login Rewards, Records, and Leaderboards, there is plenty of ways to earn, brag about, and immortalize yourself <strong>For the Glory of Gods</strong>!",
